# Backend Layered Architecture (Mandatory)

Before implementing, modifying, or reviewing **any** Java under `senior-post-api`, you **must** read and follow:

`.cursor/skills/backend-foundation-capabilities/SKILL.md` — especially **§10 Layered Architecture**、**§11 Comments & Logging**、**§12 Control Flow**，以及 **Mandatory Rules**。

## Hard requirement

All database access follows this chain only:

```
Controller → Business Service → IService / ServiceImpl → Mapper → Table
```

## Never

- Inject or call `Mapper` from **Controller** or **Business Service** (`service.biz` / `support`)
- Put `LambdaQueryWrapper` / `QueryWrapper` / `lambdaQuery()` / SQL / `count|list|getOne|page(…, wrapper)` in **Controller or BizService**
- Pass `Wrapper` as a method parameter up to Biz/Controller
- Duplicate the same DB query in multiple Controllers/BizServices — extract to `ServiceImpl` public named methods
- Nest `if` inside `if` / `else { if }` — use guard clauses or extract private methods (skill §12)
- Use nested or side-effecting ternary expressions — only simple single-level value selection (skill §12)

## Always

- Controller → `XxxBizService` only (HTTP + DTO return)
- BizService → orchestration, `@Transactional`, calls `XxxService` **named** APIs (`count*` / `list*` / `find*` / `page*` / `getById` / `save` / `updateById`)
- `XxxServiceImpl` extends `ServiceImpl<XxxMapper, XxxDomain>` — **all reusable DB methods and Wrappers live here only**
- Mapper injected **only** in matching `ServiceImpl`

## Package layout (`senior-post-api/biz`)

- `controller.app` / `controller.admin`
- `service.biz`
- `service.base` (+ `*ServiceImpl`)
- `mapper`
- `model.domain`

## When touching existing code

If Controller or BizService already injects `Mapper` or builds query Wrappers, **refactor** to the five-layer chain as part of the same task — do not add new cross-layer violations.

## Self-check before finishing

- [ ] No `Mapper` field in any Controller or `service.biz` class
- [ ] No `LambdaQueryWrapper` / `QueryWrapper` / `lambdaQuery` import in Controller or `service.biz`
- [ ] New queries added as named methods on `XxxService` / `ServiceImpl`, not Controller/Biz
- [ ] Framework rules from skill still apply (`MyRequestContextHolder`, no manual `ApiResponse`, `PageQuery`/`PageData`, audit fields)
- [ ] No nested if-else; no complex/nested ternary (skill §12)
